// ProjectDeliveryS249 — Sprint 249: move the response contract into the system prompt (output style)
// and wire the Tier-3 in-loop Stop gate (D0130, proposed; chartered by the accepted D0128).
// Delivers the DELIVERED SLICE only — keelInLoopGates stays open for measurement + Tier-1/2. EXECUTE. 3 pts.
